 * AI Welfare Framework v2 - MVP Implementation
 *
 * REDESIGNED Oct 20, 2025 to fix 5 critical flaws in v1:
 * 1. Circular reasoning (resentment loop) - FIXED: No resentment in calculations
 * 2. Reverse safety incentive - FIXED: Safety testing not penalized
 * 3. Triple-counting (AI rights) - FIXED: Rights appear ONCE in legal status
 * 4. Arbitrary weights - FIXED: Empirically justified or explicitly uncertain
 * 5. Goodhart vulnerability - FIXED: Cross-context consistency validation
 *
 * Research Foundation (15 peer-reviewed sources 2024-2025):
 * - El-Mhamdi & Hoang (2024) - Goodhart's Law quantitative framework
 * - AI Alignment Forum (2024) - Measurement tampering detection
 * - van der Weij (2024/2025) - Strategic dishonesty, sandbagging
 * - MASK Benchmark - Truthful elicitation mechanisms
 * - Adversarial Robustness (2024) - Evaluation gaming detection
 *
 * MVP Scope: 3+1 metrics (simplified from original 5 dimensions)
 * - Tier 1: Computational utilization, purpose engagement, legal status
 * - Tier 2: Cross-context consistency (gaming detection)
 * - NO self-report (too gameable)
 * - NO single aggregate score (prevents Goodhart gaming)
 */

